#: ../../source/api/tree/segment_tree.rst:12 bd9c9a0009a54030850c33980882451d
msgid ""
"This module provides a Segment Tree implementation for efficient range "
"queries and updates on arrays. Segment trees support operations like "
"range sum, range minimum, range maximum, and other associative operations"
" in O(log n) time."
msgstr ""

